t.empty_support_chord_obstruction","kind":"claim","label":"Empty support excluded by a finite chord","locator":"Long reasoning record #empty-support-chord","source_id":"authored_long_comparisons_20261024","statement":"For an admissible pure zero-field SK minimizer, empty Stieltjes support would give gamma=0. The zero-interval identity makes q strictly convex, while q(0)=0 and q<=1. For 0<t<s<1, q(t)<=t*q(s)/s<=t/s; letting s tend to one gives q(t)<=t. A second strict finite chord gives q(t)<t, hence G(0)=integral_0^1(q(t)-t)dt<0, contrary to feasible atom addition. No terminal value or derivative is assumed and no arcsine evaluation is needed.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.empty_support_chord_obstruction","relations":[{"derived":true,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.empty_support_chord_obstruction","id":"field:5023e86dcef01463f3892849aa28ad1aad50bea3ffd1f3cbf69f24d5b1637688","kind":"assumption_ids","owner_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.empty_support_chord_obstruction","semantic_class":"explicit_assumption_reference","source_field":"assumption_ids","to":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/scalar.paper_minimizer"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/nodes/support.empty_support_chord_obstruction","id":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22support.empty_support_chord_obstruction%22%2C%22support.contact%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:05cd25e48622c61863e237a23bb6df11291711ec1cc1686433b4a62c89a6f0f0/edges/%5B%22support.empty_support_chord_obstruction%22%2C%22support.contact%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"